Spec: Inventory

Purpose:
  Record what each media file is, without decoding frames.

Owns:
  ./inventory.rs

Must:
  ffprobe records filename, duration, width, height, and whether a video has audio.
  Photos record filename, width, and height.

Must not:
  Decode frames.
  Encode video.
  Call the network.

Scenario: long video is measured
  Given a video longer than one hour
  When inventory runs
  Then the record includes its duration and dimensions
  And no image frames are written
